// HTTP Server example.
// Run Net_Config before this script so all service ports are configured.
//
// The HTTP port serves the default Appeal page for GET and POST requests.
// A Type request returns the reserved port for another connection type.
// Run only one of the included server examples at a time.

Network Server

Print "Generic Network Server started"
Print "Open the configured local IP and HTTP port in a web browser"
Print Var Net_Local_IP
Print Var Net_HTTP_Port
Print "Use Network Stop_Server to stop the server"

Return
